 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ksM5aeUQjkQ7kNvwGCYPwl&_nc_oc=Adr88mLnb8AeCYV9IkwdndMndm0yGZBMSFu1fTe9PqFHWW3uSm6TXZDgLrX-5O5-SbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTe73Xa90tSCwjsAk67DrDey4mqpfHQPptY8aRSxCnc6g&oe=6AEB4CC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TmELCXLbKcoQ7kNvwE3qOjj&_nc_oc=Adpkkch-1G1ZQcDg5cxRcHJVz6p1xFlBiaWlDIZl8wSmrSZT7VU5S6N92IDUj01W09s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTIu9bYrNpaogDWi1Mwagdy8pZae0qzQJ5wOfModopikQ&oe=6AEB5A26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z6acd51sj00Q7kNvwEi2Bbz&_nc_oc=AdpDIE-YwcKBPVKy449LKcKW86vcBW-d4gEBzFoG-AAH3cgCVqyfS3QjS7XB5w7jbf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmTE05ETBjHOrij5b_flGA1OvV0Kyn49NuVEygxVIvVw&oe=6AEB2BDC"}, {"fil